  "body": "Modern, Affordable and Stand Alone at 18 Mahinga Kai Road, Orewa.\r\n\r\nThis Single-Level home is part of an exclusive Orewa Strathmill Development, and IS ideal for first-home buyers, downsizers, young families, or savvy investors looking for quality in a prime location.\r\n\r\nWelcome to effortless coastal living in one of Orewa's newest and fastest-growing communities.\r\n\r\nDesigned for comfort, convenience, and low-maintenance style.\r\n\r\nKey Features:\r\n* Single-Level Layout, seamless accessibility & flow throughout the entire home\r\n* Three generous bedrooms, plenty of space for the whole family, including a master suite with its own private en-suite\r\n* Two modern bathrooms, including full family bathroom plus the master en-suite, featuring sleek fixtures & contemporary finishes\r\n* Open-plan living with light-filled living and dining area designed for relaxation and entertaining\r\n* Gas for both cooking & hot water\r\n* Security camera system\r\n* Off-Street parking, convenient & right at your door\r\n* Halo -10 Year Residential Guarantee\r\n\r\nLocated just moments from Orewa Beach, vibrant local cafes, Schools, and easy motorway access.\r\n\r\nContact us today to arrange a private viewing or join us at the next open home!",
